# RestoStack

Multi-tenant restaurant SaaS. Repo `RestoStack/2054883SAM` is source of truth.

## Before coding

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ACCESS.md`.
- `main` is nearly empty — work from the latest full-app feature branch (see `docs/DEVELOPER.md`).
- Do not commit `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`.

## Product locks

- Landing homepage: demo-request gated (no Staff login / Create restaurant CTAs).
- Demo tenant: Italian Bistro (`italian-bistro`); entry `/demo`.
- Tenant column: `restaurant_id` on `v2_*` tables.
- Prefer `src/lib/v2-data.ts` for data access.
- Keep existing green-accent admin UI; no drive-by redesigns.

## Key paths

- `src/routes/` — app routes
- `src/lib/v2-data.ts` — data hooks
- `src/integrations/supabase/config.ts` — public Supabase defaults
- `supabase/migrations/` — schema
- `docs/` — developer handbook

